{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att anta regeringens lagförslag samt att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 1 från V.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: adopting the government's legislative proposal and rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 1 by V.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "Government's Bill", "dok_titel": "Strengthened Protection Against Foreigners Constituting Qualified Security Threats", "forslag_text": "The Riksdag adopts the Government's proposal for an amendment to the Act (2022:700) on Special Control of Certain Foreigners.\nThereby the Riksdag approves Government Bill 2025/26:267 and rejects the motions\n\n2025/26:4188 by Gudrun Nordborg et al. (V) and\n\n2025/26:4192 by Ulrika Westerlund et al. (MP) request 1.", "notis": "Protection against foreigners constituting qualified security threats is to be strengthened. The Riksdag approved the Government's proposal.\nThe proposal means, among other things, that\n\npossibilities for detention are expanded, including longer detention periods and a lower burden of proof for detention of adults\nthe conditions for deciding on deportation are clarified\npenalties for certain offenses under the law are tightened.\n\nThe legislative changes enter into force on March 1, 2027.", "alternatives": ["The Riksdag adopts the Government's proposal for an amendment to the Act (2022:700) on Special Control of Certain Foreigners.\nThereby the Riksdag approves Government Bill 2025/26:267 and rejects the motions\n\n2025/26:4188 by Gudrun Nordborg et al. (V) and\n\n2025/26:4192 by Ulrika Westerlund et al. (MP) request 1.", "Reservation 1"]}, "votering_id": "1786EB01-C5E8-42B5-93DF-5ED372C4A9D5", 